    "detailed_description": "Become an electrifying comet in a retro universe inspired by the '80s! Navigate through neon-lit levels, devour smaller asteroids, and find the black hole to advance to the next stage. All while being immersed in a synthwave atmosphere and neon graphics reminiscent of the best '80s arcade cabinets.<br><br><strong>Retro Universe:</strong> Graphics and music inspired by the '80s for a nostalgic experience.<br><br><strong>Simple but Addictive Gameplay:</strong> Control a comet and devour asteroids to gain power.<br><br><strong>Unique Mechanics:</strong> Find and enter black holes to progress through the levels.<br><br><strong>Synthwave Ambiance:</strong> An electrifying soundtrack that will keep you on the edge of your seat.<br><br><strong>Challenges and Rewards:</strong> Increasingly difficult levels with rewards up for grabs.",
